Take about 5 g of the sample, powder it and add nhexane (20 ml) stir for 10 min thoroughly over a water-bath; pour out nhexane. Repeat the process thrice adding fresh quantities of nhexane; discard nhexane washings. Wash thoroughly the sediment in hot water. Take a few mg of washed material, stain with  iodine solution  and mount in 50 per cent glycerine. Clarify a few mg with chloral hydrate and mount in 50 per cent glycerine. Observe the following characters in different mounts.

